## Running Tests

```bash
# Full offline test suite (62 tests, no API calls)
pytest tests/ -v

# Include live Ensembl VEP API tests (requires internet)
CLARVAR_LIVE_TESTS=1 pytest tests/ -v

# With coverage report
pytest tests/ --cov=clarvar --cov-report=html
```

